{"id":"n31665-1-37","stage":1,"title":"결혼 · 结婚","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n31665-1-37-1","ko":"결혼 후에도 직장은 계속 다닐 거지?","zh":"结婚之后也还会继续上班吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"결혼","meaning":"结婚","explanation":"결혼：结婚。","readings":[{"term":"결혼","audio":"/audio/da38b2d66ddadc4ca840.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31665","senseId":"1","lemma":"결혼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"결혼","audio":"/audio/da38b2d66ddadc4ca840.mp3"}},{"text":"후에도","meaning":"后，以后，之后","explanation":"후：后，以后，之后；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"후","audio":"/audio/084a4bd8972f8d494487.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62885","senseId":"1","lemma":"후","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"후에도","audio":"/audio/2a3a8d1510088a5e773c.mp3"}},{"text":"직장은","meaning":"工作单位，职场","explanation":"직장：工作单位，职场；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"직장","audio":"/audio/fdfb4ffae29b3defcce4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58297","senseId":"1","lemma":"직장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"직장은","audio":"/audio/e7b951c968282e8f86a8.mp3"}},{"text":"계속","meaning":"继续，持续","explanation":"계속：继续，持续。","readings":[{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17692","senseId":"1","lemma":"계속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}},{"text":"다닐","meaning":"上班，上学，上","explanation":"다니다：上班，上学，上；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"3","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다닐","audio":"/audio/255e8ded76b2f909559e.mp3"}},{"text":"거지?","meaning":"还会……吧？（确认预期安排）","explanation":"거：表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末；与前面的 -ㄹ 合用，-ㄹ 거지? 在此确认未来的安排；不是要求对方发誓。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"4","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거지","audio":"/audio/a9e973ff709d931a2b92.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da38b2d66ddadc4c","term":"결혼","zh":"结婚","audio":"/audio/da38b2d66ddadc4ca840.mp3","entryId":"31665","definition":"男性和女性在法律上成为夫妻。","pronunciation":["결혼"]},{"id":"084a4bd8972f8d49","term":"후","zh":"后，以后，之后","audio":"/audio/084a4bd8972f8d494487.mp3","entryId":"62885","definition":"一定时间过去以后。","pronunciation":["후ː"]},{"id":"fdfb4ffae29b3def","term":"직장","zh":"工作单位，职场","audio":"/audio/fdfb4ffae29b3defcce4.mp3","entryId":"58297","definition":"指收取报酬而上班的地方。","pronunciation":["직짱"]},{"id":"23a9f0224cc40ec0","term":"계속","zh":"继续，持续","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3","entryId":"17692","definition":"连续不间断。","pronunciation":["계ː속","게ː속"]},{"id":"02309ed22c9c3627","term":"다니다","zh":"上班，上学，上","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3","entryId":"29702","definition":"定期往返于职场或学校等地方。","pronunciation":["다니다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/4b3ececb1689a3e519d2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n31665-1-37-2","ko":"아기를 낳기 전까지는 다니려고 해.","zh":"在生孩子之前，我打算继续工作。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아기를","meaning":"小孩，婴儿","explanation":"아기：小孩，婴儿；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"아기","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20235","senseId":"1","lemma":"아기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아기를","audio":"/audio/c2dabf389488da4b2cda.mp3"}},{"text":"낳기","meaning":"生","explanation":"낳다：生；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。","readings":[{"term":"낳다","audio":"/audio/2f8905ecc8e062b159a5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64391","senseId":"1","lemma":"낳다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"낳기","audio":"/audio/457945